# Ron on the post-kan discard of the fourth kan by a second seat
# (engine.md §4.1 rows 1/4, §4.2, rules.md §4.22).
# Seat 0 makes 3 closed kans (1m, 9m, 1p), discards 2z.
# Seat 1 makes the 4th kan (ankan 9p), draws rinshan 7s (no win), discards 7s.
# Seat 2 rons 7s -> Row 1 (Ron) overrides Row 4 (suukaikan abort)!
# Scoring for Seat 2 (non-dealer, West):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s
#   Dora indicators: 1z, 2z, 3z, 4z, 7z -> dora 2z, 3z, 4z, 1z, 5z (0 dora in hand)
#   Yaku: pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 2 han 30 fu -> 2000 from Seat 1.

